Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.82,0:00:03.64,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What's this? A tongue twister?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:05.36,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:08.64,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,Leave the tongue twister to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.28,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks! You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:13.06,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's got a lot of big words, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.12,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.99,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay, take turns and let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:18.69,Broadcast,ALL,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.97,0:00:14.12,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is a message from Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:18.69,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,By streaming this, she's telling me \Nshe's in the broadcast club.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:20.83,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,So why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.77,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why won't she reveal herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.69,0:00:21.29,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is from "Love You All."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.77,Broadcast - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Thanks for writing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:28.03,Broadcast,IKO,0,0,0,,"I'd like to know how to join \Nthe Shinobu-chan fanclub," they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.03,0:00:29.73,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,{\an2}Hey, wait! There's no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:34.51,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:32.71,Broadcast,NENE,0,0,0,,{\an2}Sure there is. \NAnd boys aren't allowed to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.71,0:00:34.79,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:37.34,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, so boys are welcome, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:38.64,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:39.74,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Urk...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:42.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hide all you want. I'll just find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:44.02,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.61,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll fulfill our promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:47.34,Main - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yeah! Peaceful is best!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:49.98,Main - Top,NENE,0,0,0,,That's our vice prez for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.74,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Way to wrap up the topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:49.98,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll make professionals out of you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:55.03,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ARISU: I'LL FULFILL OUR PROMISE.\NI'LL MAKE PROFESSIONALS OUT OF YOU ALL!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.40,0:00:55.03,Broadcast,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A healthy voice dwells in a healthy body!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.38,0:02:35.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,These early morning runs should help \Nyour voices advance to the next level!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:39.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay, but 6 AM is way too early! Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.83,0:02:42.32,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want ice cream...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:46.10,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, that seagull \Nhas something in its beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:47.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My word!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:50.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is that the earbud I lost yesterday?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.94,0:02:56.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How are you faster than all of us \Nin reverse? That's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:58.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:00.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That should do it for the warmup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.17,0:03:02.50,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,My heart's about to explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh? An irregular pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:07.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A rapid heartbeat can be caused by \Nnerves or excitement, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:12.70,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,How the heck is he perfectly fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.17,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wait, never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.55,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why are you acting like our coach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:20.01,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are you serious about making us pros?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:21.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have never not been serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.48,0:03:26.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rest assured. I am the very definition \Nof a man of his word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:27.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Drop the smug act!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:32.58,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Now, now, Nene-chan. \NIt's true that we've been slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:35.98,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,And we did talk about exercising, \Nso this works out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:38.62,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you're here, Nene?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You sure talk a big game, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why're you so set on making us pros?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.23,0:03:48.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Is it really just \Nyour perfectionist nature talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:54.32,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Can we really trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:04:00.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Of course. I am the rising tide \Nthat will lift all your boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:02.11,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How about you back up \Nyour claim, errand boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.11,0:04:04.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Gladly, but before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,breakfast comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:06.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We're going to a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.59,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,N-Not sure that's the best idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.14,0:04:14.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I want to stop by our club room first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.26,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.26,0:04:16.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's with you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.57,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:19.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:23.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're all sweaty, so we wanna change!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.45,0:04:26.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.21,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.75,0:04:28.21,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRAINING REGIMEN - UZUKI SHINOBU
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:32.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They detail your issues \Nas well as training regimens to fix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:35.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've also listed reference materials \Nand works that might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:37.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They're all perfectly tailored \Nto each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:41.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Take a look and marvel at \Nthe depth of my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow, this is really detailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:46.18,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why am I the only one with a huge pile?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.68,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ELEMENTARY SCHOOL KANJI
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Because kanji drills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:50.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You need to get better with them first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:53.70,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It says my goal is to take \Na VTuber agency audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:56.82,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, and mine's to complete \Nan Anchor 101 course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.65,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Mine's to pass the Level 3 \NKanji Aptitude Test?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:00.95,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,And you, Rikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:05.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sell 50 copies of my own CD \Nat a street performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:08.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Indeed. It's a good way to gain \Nconfidence and experience, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:11.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.67,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Say, Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.63,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Have you ever played an instrument?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:16.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:20.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But if I stretch the definition a little, \NI do enjoy whistling after a bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.78,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:25.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea \Nhow much courage it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,to play and sing in front of a crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:32.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't, but it's a bridge you'll \Nhave to cross if you want to go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:35.31,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ROAD TO BECOMING A SINGER\NULTIMATE GOAL: CHART ON THE BILLBOARD
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:35.33,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Surely you've felt your hands \Nshake from nerves, at least?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.33,0:05:38.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Never. Nervousness is not \Nin a Yamabuki's dictionary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.96,0:05:41.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You've never been nervous in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.12,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.58,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:53.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"All talk"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.97,0:05:56.89,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't see why I should listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:05:58.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wha? H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hoo boy, he made her mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Off with his head, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:08.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Excuse me! I'd like an ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's gotten into Inohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:13.53,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,She's mad, and rightfully so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:19.07,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,She's good enough to write her own songs,\N but some jerk who's all talk—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:22.69,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,who can't even read sheet music—\Nthinks he can order her around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:25.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Stop it, Nene-chan. \NDon't kick him when he's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.95,0:06:28.78,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What? I'm just stating facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:29.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.80,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bucky's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:34.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A... All talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:36.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who, yours truly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Whoa, you brought him to his knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:42.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What a massive insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:46.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nobody has ever said that to me! \NOnly my big sis, little sis, and mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.35,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That's quite the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.18,0:06:56.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She must be an amazing musician \Nto have the gall to say I'm all talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:06:59.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I need to hear for myself \Njust how good she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:01.81,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.81,0:07:03.11,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:07.70,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Inohana Rikka does mini-concerts \Nevery Wednesday after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:10.02,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She performs in the school courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:14.71,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her female fans camp out there, \Nmaking it hard for boys to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:17.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Thanks for joining me again this week!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:22.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Th-This is a bigger audience \Nthan I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:23.21,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.97,Main,F. STUDENT A,0,0,0,,There's a {\i1}boy{\i0} here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:27.34,Main,F. STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Keep your skeevy eyes off our Rikka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait! I'm a member \Nof the broadcasting club!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:36.39,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This still makes me nervous every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.40,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wonder if you all can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.40,0:07:40.40,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}WAITING FOR THE STREAM TO BEGIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.90,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}APOLLO HAS STARTED STREAMING\N"MIDNIGHT HEART TUNE"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.90,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,This still makes me nervous every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.98,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:46.86,Broadcast Flashback - Top,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Sorry if I miss a few notes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.98,0:07:46.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry if I miss a few notes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.02,0:07:53.20,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Whoa, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:09.40,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Ah, when did I start yearning for a goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:16.60,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I was happy just walking down my path
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.99,0:08:20.71,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I hear voices telling me I can't do it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.71,0:08:24.27,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I keep going with my head held high
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.27,0:08:27.92,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Because burning deep inside of me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:31.70,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Is a dazzling light, a soaring heartbeat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:36.15,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,They never let me forget
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.15,0:08:39.96,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I run, and I run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:43.55,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As my heart wills me to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.55,0:08:47.21,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And I write, and I write
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:51.04,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My tell-all life story
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.04,0:08:54.62,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I break, and I break through
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:58.33,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,All the walls fate puts before me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.33,0:09:02.02,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I crumble, and I fall
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:06.60,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I still reach out for what lies ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:10.84,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's my own personal theory
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:22.46,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:26.94,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,When I heard Inohana sing, \NI saw a glimpse of Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.77,0:09:30.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The next song will be my last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.30,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If you don't have any requests, \NI guess I could—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.30,0:09:35.39,Main,F. STUDENT A,0,0,0,,Play that new KinFri song!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:36.64,Main,F. STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.39,0:09:36.64,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NEW SONGS - LYRICS 2 FOR CONCERTS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.26,Main,F. STUDENT C,0,0,0,,I love the dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.35,Main,F. STUDENT D,0,0,0,,Can you do that one, Rikka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:42.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.69,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why'd you have to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.85,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I didn't want you listening to my songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.29,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:05.23,Main,F. STUDENT A,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.23,0:10:07.33,Main,F. STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Can't wait for next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.39,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.83,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If it isn't Mr. All-Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:11.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Stop calling me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:14.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You came to hear me sing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.93,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well? Is your heart mine now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.59,0:10:18.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes, that was incredible! \NYou took my breath away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:20.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Allow me to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:23.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have no doubt that your \Nstreet performance will be a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.15,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Kiss my ass all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:32.08,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but I'm still not going to do as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:47.46,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun's stopped coming to watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.59,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He hasn't been showing up \Nfor club, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:52.14,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I guess I went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:54.32,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I should apologize when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.55,Main,F. STUDENT A,0,0,0,,Give us Rikka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.48,Main,F. STUDENT B,0,0,0,,We're not here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.48,0:10:59.82,Main,F. STUDENT C,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:04.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Thank you all for coming to see \Nyours truly's first-ever concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.51,Main,F. STUDENT D,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.51,0:11:06.91,Main,F. STUDENT E,0,0,0,,Nobody came to see your sorry ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:07.95,Main,F. STUDENT F,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.95,0:11:09.44,Main,F. STUDENT G,0,0,0,,Sell your guitar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Tough crowd, much? \NI've only played one song!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Inohana. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Putting on a show, that's what. \NRemember what you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.06,0:11:22.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You said that I was all talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's why I secretly worked \Non my guitar and vocal skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All to prove you wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:31.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Prove me wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.36,0:11:34.63,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You learned to play \Nthe guitar just for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:35.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Mhm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:36.80,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:38.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.51,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:45.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you all that \NI'll be performing with him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.52,Main,GIRLS,0,0,0,,Huh? What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:48.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wha? How's that going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:50.15,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.48,0:11:53.10,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Play however you like. I'll back you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:57.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-O...kay? Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.84,0:12:06.93,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Way to make a mess out of my show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:07.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.27,0:12:09.88,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:13.71,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You had to have been nervous. \NWas your heart pounding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Like I said before, I don't get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:20.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly has seen \Nnot just some, but {\i1}all{\i0} the shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:23.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've got nothing but ice in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.99,0:12:26.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,There you go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:27.90,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sure as the sun rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:36.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whoa! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:44.99,Main,EPTITLEA SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}LIAR.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:51.00,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm heading out. I've got plans again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.82,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You've sure been busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:55.34,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Someone's up to no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.23,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,And someone's wrong as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:58.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.09,0:13:02.47,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}ELEMENTARY SCHOOL KANJI
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:02.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,At this rate, passing the Level 3 Kanji \NAptitude Test will remain a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's your dream, not mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.01,0:13:08.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nene-chan's been \Nkind of a stranger lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:11.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Those were the eyes of \Na girl with something to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:14.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She must be up to no good, \Nlike Kirino said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:16.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How can you be sure, Uzuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.15,0:13:21.45,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I mean, it's super obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:24.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,When Nene-chan's lying...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:29.19,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I know what Uzuki said, \Nbut I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:35.17,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry for summoning you here."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:37.71,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's practicing in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:41.90,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,A soft, pleasant voice, much like \Na cat that wants some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:44.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"Before you leave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.39,0:13:48.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,there is something I must tell you."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.39,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It really does feel familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:49.86,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:51.14,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,However, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.14,0:13:53.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your acting downright sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:53.60,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,E-Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:56.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Can you try to put some emotion into it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:58.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's nothing like what I heard \Nfrom you before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:00.69,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't spy on me, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:02.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"Knightly Love"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't you know? \NIt's the hottest manga right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,{\i1}Knightly Love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.32,0:14:11.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,A tale of forbidden love between princess \Nand soldier, and it's got all the feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:11.58,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KNIGHTLY LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:14.50,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The princess rushes \Nto the fallen soldier's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:18.84,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How she wants to hold him, but \Nnobody can find out about their romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.84,0:14:21.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So she pretends to brush \Nthe dirt off him...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.72,0:14:24.55,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,and secretly plants a kiss on his helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:27.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is this what you're into, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.13,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Dude, your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:31.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Admiring my flawless\N complexion, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.47,0:14:33.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I meant it was too close, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:35.98,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KNIGHTLY LOVE: ANIME ADAPTATION CONFIRMED!\NAUDITIONS FOR PRINCESS ROLE OPEN!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.19,0:14:35.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,An audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.11,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Get out. I need to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:38.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're trying out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's not any of your business. \NStay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:43.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, but it is, so I'm staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:46.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I promised to make you \Nall pros, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.29,0:14:47.96,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:50.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll have you know I wet my bed \Nduring my middle school trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.70,0:14:51.80,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've also wet myself \Nfrom pain at the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:55.31,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Why are you sharing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've also been scolded for overfilling \Nthe containers for urine tests!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:01.11,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Just how messed up is your bladder, dude?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:04.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you're embarrassed, \NI'll be embarrassed with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:08.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well? Feel like speaking up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.19,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I am trying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.19,0:15:14.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's just, I've never...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:19.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's just, I've never been \Nin a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I don't know how to act out \Na confession scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:26.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm being serious here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:29.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"If you lack experience, \Ngo out and get some."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:32.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's Yamabuki Family Tenet Number 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:33.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Nene...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.97,0:15:35.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's be lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:40.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.09,0:15:42.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:46.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The line from the scene where \Nthe soldier asks the princess out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:49.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Starting today, I'm the soldier \Nand you're the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:53.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Act as my lover until the audition \Nto get used to the role.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.61,0:15:56.18,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:58.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,When is the audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:00.33,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,In three weeks, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.33,0:16:03.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? So, in your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:08.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,your dream's not even worth keeping up \Na pretense for a mere three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:12.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All that love you showed the manga \Nearlier must've been fake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.54,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 1 AS LOVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.10,Main,SHIRATORI,0,0,0,,Nene-chan has a boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.46,Main,SHINAGAWA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.18,Main,WAKAO,0,0,0,,Ugh, look at that punchable face!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:28.97,Main,TANAKA,0,0,0,,But she said she had no time for love!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:32.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A breeze most pleasant, \Nwouldn't you say, my princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.52,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-Ye-Yes, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:37.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.96,0:16:40.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you all right, my princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:43.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:47.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your heels are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:49.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll give you a ride on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.24,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:54.84,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,He's copying the manga beat for beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:59.04,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Is he gonna act out the story \Nfor three whole weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.46,0:17:02.88,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, the manga's \Nfinal chapter has...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.45,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Is he planning to do the kiss scene, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 3 AS LOVERS\NBROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:17.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You two were an item?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.35,0:17:21.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Your faces are sheer horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:22.59,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay, say, "Aah."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:23.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:25.69,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 10 AS LOVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How beautiful the moon is tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:27.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,All I see are clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:29.57,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 15 AS LOVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:29.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Whoa, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:33.07,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 19 AS LOVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.57,0:17:32.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm wearing a skirt, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:34.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So was the princess in the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:38.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're not heavy at all, my princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:40.61,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That line's not in the manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:43.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,They're sure not acting like lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:45.67,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,If anything, they're bickering more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:47.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why can't you put more heart into it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:49.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Because I have to look \Nat your stupid face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:52.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Now, now. It just shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:55.72,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,how much closer they've gotten now, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.31,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}DAY 20 AS LOVERS
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:00.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The audition is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:04.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We've perfectly acted out the manga's \Nstory over these three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:06.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, do you have a better \Nunderstanding of the role now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:07.69,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:11.10,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,We did pretty much all the events \Nthe princess experienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.10,0:18:15.48,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,The boat ride, the feeding scene, \Nand the princess carry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:19.58,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,All that's left is \Nthe final chapter's k-k...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:20.90,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:24.03,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,The way this is going, \Nwe might just kiss for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:27.17,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,What do I do? \NMy lips are all chapped right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.13,0:18:32.78,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Wait, was the coaching just an excuse? \NHe just wanted to kiss me all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:36.01,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh, disgusting. Why are boys like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.43,0:18:38.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't think we missed anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:44.77,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Nah, even I can tell that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:47.84,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,He was seriously trying to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:50.10,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,He read the manga more than me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:52.86,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,and played the role \Nof the soldier to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:55.91,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,My acting has gotten way better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,All right. Now you just need...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.35,0:19:03.26,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Yep, called it. "Now you just need \Nto practice the kiss," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:07.50,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm not happy about it, \Nbut practice is practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now you just need to rest up \Nbefore the audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.22,0:19:24.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.73,0:19:26.53,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're not practicing the kiss scene?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.53,0:19:27.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Obviously not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.53,0:19:29.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But you were so into the lovers thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:33.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Save that kind of thing for someone \Nyou're actually in love with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:41.66,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Stupid! You'll regret this forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:44.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I am not stupid. \NI got top scores on my exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.21,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You stupid idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.21,0:19:47.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:50.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Believe in yourself. \NI know you'll ace the audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It was just a tiny bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:57.59,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,These past three weeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:00.89,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I may have had \Nthe tiniest bit of fun, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:04.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:10.23,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I got rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why? My program was perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:23.24,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,They're saying online that \Nthe author handpicked his favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:28.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's not fair... \NNo, I should've seen it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.36,0:20:29.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If only I had more foresight...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:36.65,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,The princess rushes \Nto the fallen soldier's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:38.69,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,How she wants to hold him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:41.51,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,but nobody can find out \Nabout their romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:47.56,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,So she pretends to \Nbrush the dirt off him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.08,0:20:51.14,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,and secretly plants \Na kiss on his helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:55.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Did you do something just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.96,0:20:56.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:59.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm heading out, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.57,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You just kissed me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:07.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I could tell from \Nyour breathing and posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:12.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm guessing you reenacted that scene \Nyou said had all the feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:17.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I apologize if I'm mistaken, \Nbut Himekawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.38,0:21:20.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you in love with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.84,0:21:25.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,And here I was trying \Nto make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:28.73,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Get over yourself, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.62,0:21:31.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.63,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:33.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:38.07,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:43.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What could've possibly brought \Na boy down to one knee in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:45.12,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Did you miss a penalty kick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:50.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Y-Yours truly is now a hated man, \Nand it's all down to my hubris!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.23,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.98,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well, I'm pretty sure \Nthe "I hate you" was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:21:59.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:02.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's super obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.39,0:22:06.18,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,When Nene-chan's lying...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.93,Main,EPTITLEB SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}HIMEKAWA NENE'S EARS GIVE IT AWAY.
